Suggests: python3-secretstorage, gnome-keyring
Description: GTK4/libadwaita SMB/CIFS share manager
 MounThor stores SMB share settings and mounts CIFS network shares.
 Passwords can be requested when needed, kept in Secret Service, or
 explicitly saved in the JSON configuration file.
